{"ts":1780341281267,"state_hash":"64d9ca89e1f16cb9","passage":"StartingCanvas_canvas_first_morning_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: First morning (canvas_first_morning) | Node: First morning\n\n\n\nHis mug is rinsed and upside down in the rack the way he always leaves it. The burner he used is still warm when she sets the back of her hand against it. Six-forty, maybe. She'd lost the habit of knowing what time it was.\n\nThe window above the sink looks out at the parking lot and, past it, a diner sign two blocks down with one dead letter. MEL'S. She'd noticed it when they drove in from the bus station with her three bags. She hadn't gone in yet.\n\nLook at the sign.\n\n\n\n\n","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> First morning <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(canvas_first_morning)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> First morning</div><br><p>His mug is rinsed and upside down in the rack the way he always leaves it. The burner he used is still warm when she sets the back of her hand against it. Six-forty, maybe. She'd lost the habit of knowing what time it was.</p><span id=\"cascade-4e866a16-d5ab-4a35-bf92-71bd1d129392-beat-0\"><p>The window above the sink looks out at the parking lot and, past it, a diner sign two blocks down with one dead letter. MEL'S. She'd noticed it when they drove in from the bus station with her three bags. She hadn't gone in yet.</p><span id=\"cascade-4e866a16-d5ab-4a35-bf92-71bd1d129392-beat-1\"><a class=\"link-internal macro-linkreplace\" tabindex=\"0\">Look at the sign.</a><span class=\"macro-linkreplace-insert\"></span></span></span><br><br><br><br><br>","modal_text":null,"variables_snapshot":{"last_game_passage":"StartingCanvas_canvas_first_morning_Node_1","player":{"name":"Maya","portrait":"maya.jpg","current_location":"","core_traits":{"corruption":0,"arousal":0,"energy":100,"hygiene":100,"money":60,"hank_stage":0,"ben_stage":0,"cole_stage":0,"rosa_stage":0,"fitness":0,"beauty":0,"exhibitionism